The '''web-badges''' repository is a collection of Web-Badges/buttons used by the developer. This repository is currently a '''work in progress''' (WIP) and contains various badges/buttons that can be utilized in web development projects. The repository provides a centralized location for accessing and managing these badges/buttons, making it easier to implement them in different applications.

== Overview ==
The '''web-badges''' repository is a compilation of Web-Badges/buttons that serve as visual indicators or interactive elements on websites. These badges/buttons can be used to provide information, initiate actions, or enhance the user experience. The repository's primary purpose is to store and manage these badges/buttons, allowing for easy access and reuse in various web development projects.

=== Features ===
The '''web-badges''' repository includes a range of Web-Badges/buttons with different functionalities and designs. Some of the key features of this repository include:
* A collection of Web-Badges/buttons with varying styles and purposes
* A centralized location for managing and accessing these badges/buttons
* Ease of implementation in web development projects

